  "notes": "Optional tracking-only action-skill preview for eight weapon skills. Real damage earns base practice; confirmed rifle and bow headshots add a bounded bonus. Ranks, attributes and points do not change. Preview is off by default and has a separate adjustable speed. DSD Arsenal 1.2.1 weapon tags are supported. Fixed a startup failure in the previous hotfix build; rebuilt from the corrected source so storage, nearby crafting and recipe UI patches load again. The preview now shows a brief practice toast during combat. Reloads, power attacks, status attribution, passive/mastery routes and live balance remain pending.",
